  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Apoyo Sistema Nacional Ambiental</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for National Environment System</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE OBJECTIVE IS TO SUPPORT THE ESTABLISMENT OF A MODERN LEGAL AND INSTITUTIONAL FRAMEWORK FOR ENVIRONMENTAL MANAGEMENT IN PARAGUAY. THE PROGRAM WILL SUPPORT THE FORMATION OF THE NORMATIVE ENVIRONMENTAL AGENCY, WITH RESPONSIBILITY FOR COORDINATING AND MONITORING THE NATIONAL ENVIRONMENT SYSTEM, AS WELL AS THE SECTORAL AGENCIES RESPONSIBLE FOR IMPLEMENTING ENVIRONMENTAL MANAGEMENT</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
